{"id":"deinetwegen","lemma":"deinetwegen","pos":"adv","rank":2959,"glosses":["because of you (2nd person singular), for your sake","as far as you (2nd person singular) are concerned (you don't mind if); for all you care"],"ipa":"/ˈdaɪ̯nətˌveːɡən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3f/De-deinetwegen.ogg/De-deinetwegen.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Deinetwegen ist jetzt alles hin.","en":"Everything is ruined because of you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593184","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"everything"},{"g":"gone , left, situated"}]},{"text":"Ich bin deinetwegen gekommen.","en":"I came for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/161650","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"}]},{"text":"Ich tue das hier deinetwegen.","en":"I'm doing this for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700153","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"Deinetwegen kamen wir zu spät.","en":"It's because of you that we were late.","words":[null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"late"}]},{"text":"Deinetwegen habe ich das Gesicht verloren.","en":"You really made me lose face.","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"face"},{"g":"lost, missing"}]}]}